{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@discardableResult"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"move"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"entryID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8TempoMapV7EntryIDV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntryID","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/EntryID"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"to"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"beatTime"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8BeatTimeV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BeatTime","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/BeatTime"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8TempoMapV7EntryIDV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntryID","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/EntryID"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"entryID","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The identity of the entry to move."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"beatTime","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The new beat time for the entry."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","text":"Return Value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The identity that now addresses this entry’s content — ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entryID"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"itself, unless the move merged it into a pre-existing exact","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"duplicate, in which case the survivor’s identity. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" if","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entryID"},{"text":" did not identify any entry and nothing moved.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/UsingIvorTiming"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Unlike ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/update(entryID:tempo:extras:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", this is expected to reorder","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entries — that is the point of editing the beat time itself. Two","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entries legitimately ending up at the same beat time (see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/insert(beatTime:tempo:extras:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for the discontinuity use case) is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not treated as a collision to reject; the moved entry simply takes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its place among any others already there, exactly as a fresh","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"insertion would.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The one case where ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entryID"},{"text":" stops identifying the moved entry afterward is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when the move lands it exactly on top of another entry already","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"present — same beat time, tempo, and extras — the same exact-duplicate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"case ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/insert(beatTime:tempo:extras:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" silently collapses. There, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"moved entry merges into that pre-existing one instead of being kept","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"separately, so ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entryID"},{"text":" no longer names anything in the map; the returned","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identity is the survivor’s instead, which a caller must switch to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"addressing from then on.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivortiming\/tempomap\/move(entryid:to:)"]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap\/move(entryID:to:)"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Moves the tempo entry with the given identity to a new beat time,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeping its tempo and extras, and re-sorts it into place."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming","doc:\/\/IvorTiming\/documentation\/IvorTiming\/TempoMap"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:10IvorTiming8TempoMapV4move7entryID2toAC05EntryG0VSgAH_AA8BeatTimeVtF","title":"move(entryID:to:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"move","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"entryID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8TempoMapV7EntryIDV","text":"EntryID","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"to","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8BeatTimeV","text":"BeatTime","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10IvorTiming8TempoMapV7E